+ *//*!
+ * \file
+ * \brief XML Parser.
+ *
+ * \todo [2012-06-07 pyry] Not supported / handled properly:
+ *  - xml namespaces (<ns:Element>)
+ *  - backslash escapes in strings
+ *  - &quot; -style escapes
+ *  - utf-8
